        "bodyHtml": "<span>被动：</span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">猛击</span>伤害提升<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">10/15/20/25/30%</span>(当前<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((9 ~ 180) + ([[si:scalead]]110% 攻击力) + ([[si:scaleap]]40% 法术强度))物理伤害</span>)。<br /><br /><span>主动：</span>俄洛伊挥舞她的神像，使一条触手向前<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">猛击</span>。",
